@host = http://localhost:5293

### 1) Register a doctor (once)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register/doctor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Doctor",
  "email": "doctor@test.com",
  "phoneNumber": "01000000000",
  "password": "Test@1234",
  "specializationId": 1,
  "licenseNumber": "LIC-1001",
  "consultationFee": 200
}

### 2) BEFORE step 3: approve the doctor in the database (SQL, once)
-- UPDATE Doctors SET ApprovalStatus = 'Approved' WHERE LicenseNumber = N'LIC-1001';

### 3) Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor@test.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### 4) Get my schedules (expect 200, empty list the first time)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/doctor/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 5) Save my weekly schedule (Mon/Wed 9-5, Tue 10-2, 30 min slots)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/doctor/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "days": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "Monday", "startTime": "09:00:00", "endTime": "17:00:00", "slotLengthMinutes": 30 },
    { "dayOfWeek": "Tuesday", "startTime": "10:00:00", "endTime": "14:00:00", "slotLengthMinutes": 30 },
    { "dayOfWeek": "Wednesday", "startTime": "09:00:00", "endTime": "17:00:00", "slotLengthMinutes": 30 }
  ]
}

### 6) Get again (expect the 3 days)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/doctor/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### 7) Without a token (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/doctor/schedules

### 8) Bad data: end before start (expect 400)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/doctor/schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "days": [
    { "dayOfWeek": "Friday", "startTime": "17:00:00", "endTime": "09:00:00", "slotLengthMinutes": 30 }
  ]
}